WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.125 --> 00:00:02.377
It's strange, Lucien.

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:06.548
I feel you so close to me right now.

00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:09.551
Open, divine coffers of the heavens!

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:13.388
In the name of lord,
release your power!

00:00:16.933 --> 00:00:19.519
Save those about to ascend
to the heavens,

00:00:19.602 --> 00:00:20.603
in exchange for my life--

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:21.730
It's okay.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:24.649
Don't worry.

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:33.283
What's happening?

00:00:42.292 --> 00:00:45.253
Shut the hell up!

